batchSize.description:
number of TargetType instances to pass to map function as inValue array; inKey is going to be batch index
starting with 1;

if numBatches is not specified, batch size received by map function will be approximate;

default is 1000

not valid when numBatches is specified

numHotBuckets.description:
If set, buckets objects in the specified number of buckets. Can be used in conjunction with {@link numObjsPerHotBucket}
& {@link numHotBuckets}, and this will limit the max number of hot buckets. If not specified, a default number of
hot buckets will be created
